### Faction Reputation

**Current Score:** -100 to +100 (default: 0)
- **Positive (1 to 100):** Faction ally
- **Negative (-1 to -100):** Faction enemy
- **Neutral (0):** No significant relationship

**Tier Benefits:**
| Score | Rank | Mechanical Benefits |
|-------|------|---------------------|
| 1-30 | Ally Tier 1 | -10% prices in faction shops, access to common gear, basic information |
| 31-70 | Ally Tier 2 | -20% prices, access to rare gear, safe house, 1 ally per session |
| 71-100 | Ally Tier 3 | -30% prices, access to legendary gear, faction intervention (1 time per campaign), contacts in every city |
| -1 to -30 | Enemy Tier 1 | +10% prices, constant surveillance, false information |
| -31 to -70 | Enemy Tier 2 | Double prices, ambush attacks (1d4 per session), denied access to cities |
| -71 to -100 | Enemy Tier 3 | Assassins sent (2d6 veterans), bounty on your head, permanent exile |

**Propagation:**
- **Allies of this faction:** [list of allied factions] → reputation +X when you help this faction
- **Enemies of this faction:** [list of enemy factions] → reputation -X when you help this faction

> **Usage example:**
> **Current Score:** +45 (Ally Tier 2)
> **Applied benefits:**
> - 20% discount on potions from the faction alchemist
> - Access to the rare gear warehouse (greater potions, level 3-4 scrolls)
> - Safe house available in the north district
> - 1 ally (CR 3 veteran) available per session

